{
    "0": {
        "38_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ayayayaya!"
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I came to check on that intruder report,",
                "but I never thought it'd be you..."
            ]
        },
        "46_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh, hello there you pushy Tengu.",
                "Outta my way."
            ]
        },
        "54_0": {
            "lines": [
                "To think you'd come all the way up here.",
                "I wonder what you could want from me."
            ]
        },
        "62_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Did you perhaps rethink my job offer...?"
            ]
        },
        "70_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Absolutely not! I'm here on shrine maiden business!"
            ]
        },
        "78_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You? A shrine maiden? Well, a maiden's dog at most."
            ]
        },
        "86_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You've changed a bit since I last saw you though.",
                "Nice bracelet, and cool hairjob. Looks good on you."
            ]
        },
        "94_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That's not by choice, mind you.",
                "Anyways, I'm headed to the mountaintop to beat up a god."
            ]
        },
        "102_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The god of the mountain?"
            ]
        },
        "110_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Haha~",
                "So, you mean that god?"
            ]
        },
        "118_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh you know stuff? Spill the beans!"
            ]
        },
        "126_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Lately, there's a god that's been giving even us some trouble."
            ]
        },
        "134_0": {
            "lines": [
                "She keeps acting like this mountain is hers..."
            ]
        },
        "142_0": {
            "lines": [
                "And she's even come down to the foot of the mountain lately",
                "to try and gather faith..."
            ]
        },
        "150_0": {
            "lines": [
                "So that explains it. She's why the faith is all out of whack."
            ]
        },
        "158_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Alright, I got some good info there.",
                "I'll be off then. Don't try and stop me!"
            ]
        },
        "166_0": {
            "lines": [
                "If she really got out of hand, we tengu were going to go beat her,",
                "so you don't need to do anything."
            ]
        },
        "174_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh come on, I climbed up this stupid waterfall,",
                "do you think I'll just go away now?!"
            ]
        },
        "182_0": {
            "lines": [
                "But there's no way I can let you through."
            ]
        },
        "190_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The tengu patrollers won't stand for it if I let you through that easily."
            ]
        },
        "198_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Typical Tengu behaviour, eh?",
                "I guess all of you are unreasonable. Good thing I didn't take the job."
            ]
        },
        "206_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Belonging to a group means that sometimes,",
                "you don't get to have your way."
            ]
        },
        "214_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'll go easy on you! I need to write a report on you afterall!"
            ]
        },
        "222_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Uhm, can you please not write about me...?",
                "Guess I gotta kick your butt extra hard..."
            ]
        }
    },
    "1": {
        "30_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You've gotten alot stronger since last time.",
                "Could it be because of..."
            ]
        },
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Well, either way, you should be able to beat the god."
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Gods are just the next step in the hierarchy to take on!"
            ]
        },
        "46_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That god showed up here not too long ago with a shrine and a lake."
            ]
        },
        "54_0": {
            "lines": [
                "There's a new shrine up the way a bit.",
                "She should be there."
            ]
        },
        "62_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Shrine!? I see...that's...huh.",
                "Guess we got competition..."
            ]
        }
    }
}